
    
1. Css stands cascading style sheet
2. It was developed and maintain by w3c org released in 1996 year.
3. by using css you can design and style the webpages.
4. you want working with css no need any special software.
5. html contains tags , like that css provide properties
   using these properties we are deisgn the webpages.

6.css extension is .css

7.css current is version  css3.

What css syntax?
==========================

selector{

        property:value;
        property:value;
        property:value;

}

css selectors are used to select the html element for styling.
css provide number of selectors for select the element.
they divided into five categories

1. simple selectors
2. combinator selectors
3. pseudo element selectors
4. pseudo class selectors
5. attribute selectors


simple selectors: simple selectors means select the element
based on their id,name,class
                
Declartion
---------------
css declaration includes css property and value separated by colon(:).
more than one declartion is there  separated semi colon(;)
one or more then declaration is  there wrapped in curly braces.{
}


How many write the css code?(FAQ)
------------------------------------
you can write the css code three ways
1.inline css
2.internal css
3.externale css

inline css means write the css code inside html element
uisng style attribute called as inline css.



